#: admin/views/settings.php:77
msgid "Settings sections"
msgstr "Sections des réglages"

#: admin/views/settings.php:92
msgid "Translatable content types"
msgstr "Types de contenu traduisibles"

#: admin/views/settings.php:94
msgid "Enabled types get a language, the Translations box in the editor and the language columns. Pages and posts are always enabled."
msgstr "Les types activés reçoivent une langue, la boîte Traductions dans l’éditeur et les colonnes de langue. Les pages et les articles sont toujours activés."

#: admin/views/settings.php:96
#: admin/views/tools.php:36
msgid "Content types"
msgstr "Types de contenu"

#: admin/views/settings.php:108
msgid "Always on"
msgstr "Toujours actif"

#: admin/views/settings.php:115
msgid "Translatable taxonomies"
msgstr "Taxonomies traduisibles"

#: admin/views/settings.php:117
msgid "Terms of enabled taxonomies get a language and can be linked to their translations. When a translation is created, its terms are replaced by their translations."
msgstr "Les termes des taxonomies activées reçoivent une langue et peuvent être liés à leurs traductions. À la création d’une traduction, ses termes sont remplacés par leurs traductions."

#: admin/views/settings.php:119
msgid "Taxonomies"
msgstr "Taxonomies"

#: admin/views/settings.php:135
msgid "Visitor language"
msgstr "Langue du visiteur"

#: admin/views/settings.php:137
msgid "A translated page always shows in its own language. These options decide the language of pages that have none (home, archives, search)."
msgstr "Une page traduite s’affiche toujours dans sa propre langue. Ces options déterminent la langue des pages qui n’en ont pas (accueil, archives, recherche)."

#: admin/views/settings.php:139
msgid "Detect the browser language"
msgstr "Détecter la langue du navigateur"

#: admin/views/settings.php:139
msgid "On a first visit, use the first browser language that is active on the site."
msgstr "Lors d’une première visite, utiliser la première langue du navigateur active sur le site."

#: admin/views/settings.php:140
msgid "Send visitors to the home page of their language"
msgstr "Diriger les visiteurs vers l’accueil de leur langue"

#: admin/views/settings.php:140
msgid "A visitor who chose English and opens the French home page is redirected to the English home page, if it exists."
msgstr "Un visiteur qui a choisi l’anglais et ouvre l’accueil français est redirigé vers l’accueil anglais, s’il existe."

#: admin/views/settings.php:141
msgid "Filter listings by language"
msgstr "Filtrer les listes par langue"

#: admin/views/settings.php:141
msgid "Blog, archives and search only list content in the current language (and content without language). Leave off if your theme already filters its listings."
msgstr "Le blogue, les archives et la recherche ne listent que le contenu de la langue courante (et le contenu sans langue). Laissez désactivé si votre thème filtre déjà ses listes."

#: admin/views/settings.php:145
msgid "Remember the language for"
msgstr "Mémoriser la langue pendant"

#: admin/views/settings.php:146
msgid "Lifetime of the wpm_lang cookie, in days (1 to 3650)."
msgstr "Durée du témoin wpm_lang, en jours (1 à 3650)."

#: admin/views/settings.php:150
msgid "days"
msgstr "jours"

#: admin/views/settings.php:155
msgid "Search engines"
msgstr "Moteurs de recherche"

#: admin/views/settings.php:157
msgid "Output hreflang tags"
msgstr "Générer les balises hreflang"

#: admin/views/settings.php:157
msgid "Tells search engines which page is the translation of which, with x-default on the default language. Turn off only if an SEO plugin already outputs them."
msgstr "Indique aux moteurs de recherche quelle page est la traduction de quelle autre, avec x-default sur la langue par défaut. Désactivez seulement si une extension SEO les génère déjà."

#: admin/views/settings.php:177
msgid "Navigation blocks"
msgstr "Blocs Navigation"

#: admin/views/settings.php:179
msgid "A Navigation block that shows one of these menus displays the menu of the visitor language instead. You can also assign a language from the Site Editor, in the menu settings."
msgstr "Un bloc Navigation qui affiche l’un de ces menus affiche plutôt le menu de la langue du visiteur. Vous pouvez aussi attribuer une langue depuis l’éditeur de site, dans les réglages du menu."

#: admin/views/settings.php:186
msgid "No menu"
msgstr "Aucun menu"

#: admin/views/settings.php:189
#: includes/class-meta-box.php:95
#: admin/js/meta-box.js:106
#: admin/js/meta-box.js:233
msgid "(no title)"
msgstr "(sans titre)"

#: admin/views/settings.php:197
msgid "This site has no Navigation menu yet."
msgstr "Ce site n’a pas encore de menu Navigation."

#: admin/views/settings.php:201
msgid "Classic menu locations"
msgstr "Emplacements de menu classiques"

#: admin/views/settings.php:204
msgid "For classic themes: the menu shown in each location, per language. Leave empty to keep the menu set in Appearance > Menus."
msgstr "Pour les thèmes classiques : le menu affiché à chaque emplacement, par langue. Laissez vide pour garder le menu défini dans Apparence > Menus."

#: admin/views/settings.php:213
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Emplacement"

#: admin/views/settings.php:239
msgid "The active theme registers no classic menu location: menus are handled by Navigation blocks above."
msgstr "Le thème actif ne déclare aucun emplacement de menu classique : les menus passent par les blocs Navigation ci-dessus."

#: admin/views/settings.php:266
msgid "Form translations"
msgstr "Traductions des formulaires"

#: admin/views/settings.php:268
msgid "Link the versions of a form: wherever one of them is inserted, visitors see the version of their language."
msgstr "Liez les versions d’un formulaire : partout où l’une d’elles est insérée, les visiteurs voient la version de leur langue."

#: admin/views/settings.php:271
msgid "No supported form plugin"
msgstr "Aucune extension de formulaire prise en charge"

#: admin/views/settings.php:271
msgid "Activate Contact Form 7 or Gravity Forms to translate forms."
msgstr "Activez Contact Form 7 ou Gravity Forms pour traduire les formulaires."

#: admin/views/settings.php:285
#: admin/views/strings.php:27
#: includes/class-strings-admin.php:206
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "Extension"

#: admin/views/settings.php:289
#: admin/views/settings.php:367
#: includes/class-strings-admin.php:166
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Actions"

#: admin/views/settings.php:298
msgid "Form plugin"
msgstr "Extension de formulaire"

#: admin/views/settings.php:318
msgid "Remove this form group"
msgstr "Retirer ce groupe de formulaires"

#: admin/views/settings.php:343
msgid "No form is linked yet."
msgstr "Aucun formulaire n’est encore lié."

#: admin/views/settings.php:344
msgid "Link a form"
msgstr "Lier un formulaire"

#: admin/views/settings.php:352
msgid "Template parts per language"
msgstr "Parties de modèle par langue"

#: admin/views/settings.php:353
msgid "Open the Site Editor"
msgstr "Ouvrir l’éditeur de site"

#: admin/views/settings.php:355
msgid "Header, footer and other parts can have one version per language. Open a part in the Site Editor: the Languages panel of its settings assigns its language and creates the other versions."
msgstr "L’en-tête, le pied de page et les autres parties peuvent avoir une version par langue. Ouvrez une partie dans l’éditeur de site : le panneau Langues de ses réglages attribue sa langue et crée les autres versions."

#: admin/views/settings.php:357
msgid "Without versions, every language shares the same header and footer."
msgstr "Sans versions, toutes les langues partagent le même en-tête et le même pied de page."

#: admin/views/settings.php:363
msgid "Part"
msgstr "Partie"

#: admin/views/settings.php:381
msgid "Missing"
msgstr "Manquante"

#. translators: %s: template group.
#: admin/views/settings.php:387
#, php-format
msgid "Stop translating %s"
msgstr "Ne plus traduire %s"

#: admin/views/settings.php:394
msgid "Unlinking a part only removes its language versions from this list: the template parts themselves are kept."
msgstr "Délier une partie retire seulement ses versions de cette liste : les parties de modèle elles-mêmes sont conservées."

#: admin/views/strings.php:11
msgid "The String Translation tables are missing. Deactivate and reactivate the plugin to create them."
msgstr "Les tables de la traduction de chaînes sont absentes. Désactivez puis réactivez l’extension pour les créer."

